></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Studio Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of your bustling studio. Balance each girl's training, work, and rest schedules to maximize their efficiency, all while saving their energy for voyeur shows. Even when you're offline, your studio continues to grow, earning money and drawing in new guests. Satisfied visitors unlock more opportunities\u2014new girls, outfits, and upgrades to keep your business thriving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753260/extras/733b563a912450399467b7a2e111b5d6.poster.avif?t=1739257671\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753260/extras/733b563a912450399467b7a2e111b5d6.webm?t=1739257671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753260/extras/733b563a912450399467b7a2e111b5d6.mp4?t=1739257671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753260/extras/96dc7f584061874a638f290c22d1896d.poster.avif?t=1739257671\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753260/extras/96dc7f584061874a638f290c22d1896d.webm?t=1739257671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753260/extras/96dc7f584061874a638f290c22d1896d.mp4?t=1739257671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flirt and Bond with the Girls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charm your girls by flirting, gifting, and taking them on dates to build